  "brief": {
    "en": "Fresh at the start of a winding mountain pass — the driver is alert (low drowsiness/fatigue), so this route_music proposal is driven by the mountain ROUTE itself, not by driver-state: route_tags leads the service reasons and music_playlist rises among the driving services (the mountain safety hypothesis favours low-interaction audio over karaoke).",
    "ja": "曲がりくねった峠道の登り始め。ドライバーは覚醒しており（眠気・疲労とも低い）、このroute_music提案は運転者状態ではなく山道ルート自体が主導する。サービス理由はroute_tagsが先頭で、走行サービスの中でmusic_playlistが上位に入る（山道の安全仮説がカラオケより低操作の音声を優先）。"
